          "message": {
            "text": "Static Code Analysis / SAST Triage — No issue identified: PairVox Swift Codebase (/workspace/PairVox-main-a3e5940)\n\nExecuted semgrep, ast-grep, gitleaks, trufflehog, and trivy fs on 295 files (161 Swift source files). Artifacts saved in /workspace/.source-aware/. Verified policy enforcement, process execution filtering, remote link transport cryptography, keychain access, and diagnostic redactor logic."
