          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/authorization-policy-process-sandboxing",
          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Authorization Policy & Process Sandboxing — No issue identified: PairVoxCore Policy & Execution\n\nAudited PermissionPolicy.swift, FolderGrants.swift, ClaudeCLISession.swift, and ChildEnvironment.swift. Verified symlink resolution up to 32 depth in FolderScope, strict prefix matching, shell execution token guards (disallowing $, backticks, redirects), and ChildEnvironment variable filtering (dropping ANTHROPIC_*, CLAUDE_CODE_*, NODE_OPTIONS)."
          },
          "locations": [
