          "ruleIndex": 4,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Secret Storage & Diagnostic Information Disclosure — No issue identified: Keychain, LogRedactor & Diagnostic Controls\n\nAudited KeychainStore.swift, DeviceKeyStore.swift, LogRedactor.swift, and DiagnosticLog.swift. Verified system Keychain storage with kSecAttrAccessibleWhenUnlocked, regex scrubbing of API keys, tokens, emails, and paths in LogRedactor, and opt-in conversation logging in DiagnosticLog."
